From: Viktor Semenov <suit.uanic@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 20:48:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 26/45] Send each player's LOS and the mirages in the Specula
 feed

Feed v15. An entity's visibility is GetLosVisibility for every player,
2 bits each (hidden, fogged, visible), not one visible bit. Mirages are
sent as entities, with their player and parent, and the details of their
miraged interfaces (QueryMiragedInterface), so a player's view can show
them as the session GUI does. A new LOS record carries each player's
CLosQuerier state of every vertex, as runs of the vertices changed since
the last one. The players record says whether a player has shared LOS.

The /play autostart reads -autostart-specula-explored and
-autostart-specula-revealed and sets the map's exploration from them.
